    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Laser Games is a casual/competitive shooter, embracing the thrill and experience from real laser tag. Jump in with friends, strangers, or alone, and explore the various maps and challenges as you zap your way to the top! Play it your way- unlock and equip customizations, or contribute to the workshop with your own maps and gametypes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Laser Tag</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've played laser tag yourself as a kid, play competitively in tournaments, or have no idea what laser tag is, hop in and experience the thrill! Everything from the <strong>map style</strong> to the <strong>sounds</strong> and <strong>scorecards</strong> have been hand-crafted to recreate an <strong>authentic experience </strong>matching common laser tag places in real life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to try something new? The Laser Games has plenty to offer! Featuring <strong>traditional multiplayer gametypes </strong>like <strong>Team Tag Match </strong>and <strong>Free-For-All, </strong>and plans for<strong> unique ways to play,</strong> there's always a different way to play against other players, whether<strong> </strong>competitively or casually<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to challenge yourself, or go up against AI? The Laser Games also features <strong>custom match creation</strong> and <strong>singleplayer challenges (</strong>with scoreboards coming soon)<strong>,</strong> so you can play against the clock or against your friends, even if offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself in the game, with basic <strong>customizations </strong>such as player colors, and many other planned cosmetic options!<strong> Host your own game</strong>, with future dedicated server and Steam work support! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun For Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By design, The Laser Games is quite simply, laser tag! This means you won't be shooting and killing other players, but rather <strong>tagging and earning points.</strong> Join us in a friendly environment made to let anyone have fun without the need of super gore and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Download The Laser Games now and begin zapping away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Laser Games is a casual/competitive shooter, embracing the thrill and experience from real laser tag. Jump in with friends, strangers, or alone, and explore the various maps and challenges as you zap your way to the top! Play it your way- unlock and equip customizations, or contribute to the workshop with your own maps and gametypes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Laser Tag</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've played laser tag yourself as a kid, play competitively in tournaments, or have no idea what laser tag is, hop in and experience the thrill! Everything from the <strong>map style</strong> to the <strong>sounds</strong> and <strong>scorecards</strong> have been hand-crafted to recreate an <strong>authentic experience </strong>matching common laser tag places in real life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to try something new? The Laser Games has plenty to offer! Featuring <strong>traditional multiplayer gametypes </strong>like <strong>Team Tag Match </strong>and <strong>Free-For-All, </strong>and plans for<strong> unique ways to play,</strong> there's always a different way to play against other players, whether<strong> </strong>competitively or casually<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to challenge yourself, or go up against AI? The Laser Games also features <strong>custom match creation</strong> and <strong>singleplayer challenges (</strong>with scoreboards coming soon)<strong>,</strong> so you can play against the clock or against your friends, even if offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself in the game, with basic <strong>customizations </strong>such as player colors, and many other planned cosmetic options!<strong> Host your own game</strong>, with future dedicated server and Steam work support! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun For Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By design, The Laser Games is quite simply, laser tag! This means you won't be shooting and killing other players, but rather <strong>tagging and earning points.</strong> Join us in a friendly environment made to let anyone have fun without the need of super gore and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Download The Laser Games now and begin zapping away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
